e.\",\"conditional_conclusion\":\"An ordinary manufacturing cost transaction newly created after the threshold should be held rather than processed while the period is Pending Close. An event-specific conclusion requires the missing event's type, creation timestamp, and recorded status.\"},\"timestamp_timezone\":\"Not specified in source; none inferred.\",\"source_records_changed\":false,\"audit_artifact_path\":\"/cache/work/worker_2ef356752d28/audit-report.json\"},\"source_ids\":[\"r_5194a4192cc6e45f4d06373f\"]}",
